/E (The primary objective of this sprint is to develop and implement the core functionalities of the hospital management system. This includes optimizing workflows across both medical and administrative processes, ensuring seamless integration between user access control, patient data management, and appointment scheduling. By the end of this sprint, the team aims to create a robust foundation that will streamline hospital operations, enhance user experience, and improve overall efficiency)
